   "ruling": "Ruling: model error on the declaration; the reply reads f1040.line11, which does not resolve (invalid_model_types: \"reference 'f1040.line11' does not resolve\"); its note says the scoped catalog did not list Form 1040 line 11. i8960 p. 22, Line 13: \"If you didn't exclude any amounts from your gross income under section 911 and you don't own an interest in a CFC or PFIC, your MAGI is your AGI as reported on Form 1040 or 1040-SR.\" The project reads f1040.line11b, which copies line 11a, as the earlier rulings. Triage executable-triage-v2 (reviews/2025/transcription/triage/f8960.json; 1,638 fixtures, 500 generated returns seed 20261026, 112 partial records): 2,203 of 2,250 comparisons agree; the 47 differences are the project's line refusing or unknown on f8960.refund (12 and 12 witnesses), which the project's return does not read where it completes. Project stands.",
